# Protean {{NAME}} Sample

A **standalone** server that consumes Protean as a **published jar** ({{COORD}}:{{VERSION}}) and runs it with the
capabilities selected when this sample was generated. It is a separate Gradle project that depends on the
artifact by coordinate, exactly like a real downstream service — the jar is resolved from `mavenLocal()` (a
locally-published SNAPSHOT) or `mavenCentral()` (a released version).

> Modules are compiled at runtime with `javac`, so you must run on a **JDK 21** (not a JRE).

